<title>UK: Berisford year profit to be over 25 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Berisford year profit to be over 25 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berisford International Plc, the UK food service equipment and building and consumer products group that has been hit by a strike, said on Monday year profits before tax and exceptional items would be no less than 25 million stg.</p>
</text>
